  "about": "Arknights and Endfield events a reader can attend, for the /community map and the home panel. lat/lng place the pin; startTime drives the countdown and the LIVE NOW status, and every record gives an endTime too, each an ISO instant that names its zone (arkpedia-app scripts/tests/test-community-offline-events.ts). Official collaborations come from the publishers' own notices, the Korean ones from the KR official Naver Cafe (cafe 29703924) in KST; where a notice gives dates without hours the record spans whole days, and pins are approximate - the venue's district, or the city. \"guest\" is only a convention that itself presents its guest through Arknights: a credit alone is not enough. \"fan\" is a community-run gathering with a public event page, and such a record carries the public title, place and dates only, never an organiser's or attendee's name.",
